'''Taitenki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 14.2 Update|14.2]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]], and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]].

